 34P     18O(18O,PNG) E=24 MEV         2018LU08,2012BE11,2009BE26ENSDF    202609
 34P   H TYP=FUL$AUT=LIJIE SUN AND JUN CHEN$CIT=ENSDF$CUT=30-Sep-2026$          
 34P  dL E$Least-squares fitting is done by GLSC (version 12-Jun-2026)          
 34P  c  2018Lu08: a 24-MeV {+18}O beam was provided by the ATLAS accelerator at
 34P 2c  Argonne National Laboratory. The target was 260-|mg/cm{+2} 97%-enriched
 34P 3c  {+18}O on a 12.7-|mm Ta backing. The deexciting |g rays were detected  
 34P 4c  by Gammasphere, consisting of 101 Compton-suppressed HPGe detectors.   
 34P 5c  The evaporated protons and light charged particles were detected by the
 34P 6c  nearly 4|p Microball detector, consisting of 95 CsI(Tl) scintillators. 
 34P 7c  Measured E|g with Doppler correction, I|g, |g|g-coin, p|g-coin, and    
 34P 8c  |g(|q). Deduced levels, J, |p, and multipolarities. Comparisons to     
 34P 9c  shell model calculations using the (0+1)~h|w PSDPF interaction.        
 34P  c  2018Lu08 is a reanalysis of the 2012Be11 data with proton emission     
 34P 2c  channel selection enabled by the Microball and kinematic Doppler       
 34P 3c  corrections. 2011BeZZ is a draft of 2012Be11, providing more |g(|q) and
 34P 4c  DSAM fitting plots. The 6180 level and its 2828|g reported by 2012Be11 
 34P 5c  is removed by 2018Lu08. The 4447 level from 2012Be11 is revised to     
 34P 6c  4455. The 5281 level from 2012Be11 is revised to 6295. Two |g branches:
 34P 7c  1446|g from 3911 level and 1606|g from 3911 level are only indicated by
 34P 8c  theories of 2012Be11, which are not included here.                     
 34P  cG E,RI$From 2018Lu08, unless otherwise noted. 2012Be11 reports |g        
 34P 2cG branching ratios. 2018Lu08 and 2009Be26 report relative intensities    
 34P 3cG with I|g(429)=100. The original intensities in 2018Lu08 and 2009Be26   
 34P 4cG are given under comments.                                              
 34P  cG M,MR$From 2012Be11 |g(|q) analysis, unless otherwise noted.            
 34P  cG E(B),RI(B)$From 2012Be11 and also verified by 2018Lu08.                
 34P  cL E$From a least-squares fit to |g-ray energies.                         
 34P  cL J$From 2012Be11 |g(|q) analysis, unless otherwise noted.               
 34P  cL E(B)$Levels from 2012Be11 and also verified by 2018Lu08.               
